<title>USA: First Palm Beach to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>First Palm Beach to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Palm Beach Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 509,310 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>As of September 30, First Palm Beach said it had 5.09 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
